00:54:00,000 --> 00:54:06,000
Closet Monster is a 2015 Canadian drama film
written and directed by Stephen Dunn.

10
01:00:00,000 --> 01:00:06,000
It stars Connor Jessup as a closeted gay teenager, using elements of the
body horror genre as a metaphor for internalized homophobia.

11
01:06:00,000 --> 01:06:06,000
It premiered at the Toronto International Film Festival, where
it won the award for Best Canadian Feature.

12
01:12:00,000 --> 01:12:06,000
The film went into general theatrical release across Canada in July 2016.

13
01:18:00,000 --> 01:18:06,000
The film explores themes of hamster, tree house,
rejection, bullying, newfoundland and labrador.

14
01:24:00,000 --> 01:24:06,000
The tone is emotional and mind_bending.
